    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Chemist 10, Preserve Organs discovery</p><p>The chemist has mastered preserving flesh and applied this knowledge to his own body, turning himself into an undead-like creature. After learning this discovery, the chemist must perform a 30-day regimen of a special diet, rigorous exercise, and drinking a mildly poisonous alchemical tea. At the end of this regimen, he falls unconscious for 24 hours, then awakens as a \"living mummy.\" The chemist's type does not change, but he becomes immune to ice, nonlethal damage, disable, paralysis, and sleep.</p>",
